<title>HONG KONG: Karrie Intl offers 90 mln new shrs at HK$1.15 each.</title>
<headline>Karrie Intl offers 90 mln new shrs at HK$1.15 each.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Personal computer casings manufacturer Karrie International Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it will offer 90 million new shares at HK$1.15 each in an initial public offering (IPO) of shares in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>The issue price represents a prospective price to earnings (PE) multiple on a weighted average basis of 4.5 times and on a proforma fully-diluted basis of 5.3 times, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
